      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A Poffin ingredient.\nIf held by a Pokémon, it raises its\nDefense stat in a pinch.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "diamond-pearl",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/8/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A Poffin ingredient.\nIf held by a Pokémon, it raises its\nDefense stat in a pinch.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "platinum",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/9/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "If held by a Pokémon, it raises its\nDefense stat in a pinch.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "heartgold-soulsilver",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/10/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tenue, cette Baie monte la Défense\nen cas de besoin.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "If held by a Pokémon, it raises its\nDefense stat in a pinch.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "If held by a Pokémon, it raises its\nDefense stat in a pinch.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-2-white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/14/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ポケモンに　もたせると\nピンチのとき　じぶんの\nぼうぎょが　あがる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "포켓몬에게 지니게 하면\n위급할 때 자신의\n방어가 올라간다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tenue, cette Baie augmente la Défense en cas\nde besoin.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Als getragenes Item erhöht diese Beere den\nVerteidigungs-Wert eines Pokémon, sobald es in\neiner Notlage steckt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "El Pokémon que la lleva se libera del\nenamoramiento. Solo puede usarse una vez.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Se il Pokémon che ha questa bacca si trova\nin difficoltà, la sua Difesa aumenta.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A Berry to be consumed by Pokémon.\nIf a Pokémon holds one, its Defense\nstat will increase when it’s in a pinch.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
